Despite his intimidating silhouette, Dave''s approach to roasting is defined by creativity and silliness rather than malice. He is a writer''s roaster who prioritizes originality and visionary jokes over standard insults, often preferring to lose a battle while earning the judges'' praise for his craft than to win with "garden-variety" punchlines. This blend of a "barely conscious" exterior and a "creative innovator" interior makes him a distinct, versatile figure on the comedy circuit.', TRUE, TRUE, 0, 0, 0, 'https://rbl-ny-992338142544-us-east-1-an.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/processed/webp/1778828961779-battler.webp', 'dOfXYBu8N1KovWgOiLZ5') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET wins = EXCLUDED.wins, losses = EXCLUDED.losses, draws = EXCLUDED.draws, rating = EXCLUDED.rating;

His deep-rooted love for storytelling has led him to explore the world of horror films on his podcast, Blood, Sweat and Fears, where he shares his passion for storytelling with fellow comedians. Dean''s ability to combine humor and compelling emotional narratives has been built over years of loving and studying film and story structure. With a diverse skill set honed by years as a performer and a unique understanding into the human experience, Dean T. Beirne''s work will have you laughing while he''s on stage and turning every page.', FALSE, TRUE, 0, 0, 0, 'https://rbl-ny-992338142544-us-east-1-an.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/processed/webp/1785018896726-Dean-T.-Beirne.webp', '6cqfva8oy') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET wins = EXCLUDED.wins, losses = EXCLUDED.losses, draws = EXCLUDED.draws, rating = EXCLUDED.rating;

He has performed at some of London''s most respected rooms, including Top Secret Comedy Club, Up The Creek in Greenwich, and Backyard Comedy Club in Bethnal Green. All three are significant London venues that put new and rising acts in front of real comedy audiences, and performing at them consistently is one of the clearest signs that a comedian is building something genuine. He has also tested himself in gong show formats, where only the material that actually works survives a live audience vote.

