Celebrating spreading as a way of being and exploring the nastiest of curiosities, Anna brings you in with playful audience interaction and challenges norms with incisive stand-up. Her 3rd stand-up solo, ''High Hoe'', enjoyed a successful full run at the Edinburgh Fringe 2025 after touring Germany and Luxembourg. 

