His style is cheeky, his comedy describes living in Germany as a laid back Aussie. His music comes from a funky jazz background, he can actually play the piano. Many artists perform Musical Comedy, Dave plays Comedic Music.

He debuted his solo hour show ‘Dave Adams Has Feelings’ to sold out crowds in 2021 and has since performed all over Europe, UK, Australia and Asia. His second hour ‘Australian Alien’ premiered at the Tallinn Fringe festival in Sept 2024 to warm reception.

He has been opening act for Allan Havey (Seinfeld/Mad Men), Todd Barry (Flight of the Conchords/Louie) and Reggie Watts in Berlin, and was a writer for Comedy Central''s - "Was ich eigentlich sagen wollte." And he doesn''t even speak German.

He also appeared on Romanian Tv Show ‘Stand Up Revolution.’ Long story.

These days, he tours Europe with his Comedy Group ’Serial Killers’ a troupe of Berlin comedians bringing their expat flavour to a town near you. He is also the singer of the band ’The Fuckheads’ whose debut album is to be released in 2025.

