Ali''s stage persona combines sharp self-awareness with an underlying sense that everything in her life may be one minor inconvenience away from becoming a full-blown crisis. Drawing material from dysfunctional family dynamics, disastrous dating experiences, and the general absurdity of trying to maintain dignity in New York, she approaches roasting with a mix of dark observations, creativity, and calculated chaos. Rather than relying on predictable insults, she gravitates toward personal, imaginative angles that leave audiences wondering how she came up with them and whether they should be concerned.

This combination of fashion-industry polish, outer-borough toughness, and emotionally questionable decision-making has made Ali a distinctive and increasingly recognizable voice on the roast battle circuit.', FALSE, TRUE, 0, 0, 0, 'https://rbl-ny-992338142544-us-east-1-an.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/processed/webp/1782189193383-Ali-Feet.webp', 'za2nHt1bzRQ0xgVRbCg2') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET wins = EXCLUDED.wins, losses = EXCLUDED.losses, draws = EXCLUDED.draws, rating = EXCLUDED.rating;
