But most of all, I remember the Beer Warrior.
A time when without beer we were nothing.  Our world
crumbled.  Cities exploded — a whirlwind of looting, a firestorm
of fear.

On the shelves it was a sober nightmare. Only those inebriated
enough to scavenge, and pillage would survive.
He lost everything and became a shell of a man, a burnt-out
desolate man, a man haunted by the demons of his past, a man
who wandered out into the wasteland. And it was here, in this
blighted place, that he learned to live again.

Or Cousin Eddie meets Mad Max.', FALSE, TRUE, 0, 0, 0, 'https://rbl-ny-992338142544-us-east-1-an.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/processed/webp/1782603643810-Beer-Warrior.webp', '34R1xSji5u4ZORWkNetI') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET wins = EXCLUDED.wins, losses = EXCLUDED.losses, draws = EXCLUDED.draws, rating = EXCLUDED.rating;
